nters. Being the hunters and being the hunted.", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 8, "y": 0, "show": true}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 8, "y": 1, "show": true}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 6, "y": 2, "show": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "You'll be hunting with these Scorpion Tanks. There are two enemy Stealth Tanks in their vicinity.", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 8, "y": 0, "show": false}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 8, "y": 1, "show": false}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 6, "y": 2, "show": false}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "A Stealth Tank in waiting will cancel the move of any enemy unit that tries to travel through it and that unit will lose the rest of its turn.", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "So your best tactic when hunting Stealth Tanks is to expose it with your first unit, then strike it with your back up.", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 2, "y": 0, "show": true}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 0, "y": 2, "show": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "You'll be hunting the enemy Flaks with these two Stealth Tanks.", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 2, "y": 0, "show": false}, {"type": "highlight", "x": 0, "y": 2, "show": false}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "When hunting with Stealth Tanks, remember that you do double damage if you strike the target while you are still cloaked.", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "If you kill the target, you will not decloak. Ending your turn next to an enemy unit will always decloak your Stealth Tank.", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "Stealth Tanks have very little armor, so focus on picking off straggling targets to avoid losing your stealth cover.", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "Begin the training exercise!", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": false}], "responses": [{"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "The best way to tackle an invisible enemy is with clusters of troops. Scout ahead to expose the stealth units and then destroy them with the rest of your troops.", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "Give it another try. I'm sure it'll go better this time.", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true}], "responses": [{"type": "chat", "sender": "GENERAL PEARL", "message": "Stealth units like the Stealth Tank and U-Boat can be devastating in the hands of a capable general. On with the next lesson..", "avatar": "pearl", "color": "FFFF0000"}]}]}}